@githubjeka - for now, try to edit yii\i18n\DateTimeExtended class and change beginning of createFromFormat method to 

```
if (($originalDateTime = parent::createFromFormat($format, $time)) === false) {
        return false;
}
$originalDateTime->setTimezone($timezone);
```

It's working for me.

Are you sure? I changed this:

```
public static function createFromFormat ($format, $time, $timezone = null)
    {
        if (($originalDateTime = parent::createFromFormat($format, $time, $timezone)) === false) {
            return false;
        }
        $info = date_parse_from_format($format, $time);

        /** @var $dateTime \DateTime */
        $dateTime = new static;
        if ($info['hour'] === false && $info['minute'] === false && $info['second'] === false) {
            $dateTime->_isDateOnly = true;
        } else {
            $dateTime->_isDateOnly = false;
        }
        $ts = $originalDateTime->getTimestamp();
        $dateTime->setTimezone($originalDateTime->getTimezone());
        $dateTime->setTimestamp($originalDateTime->getTimestamp());

        return $dateTime;
    }
```

to

```
public static function createFromFormat ($format, $time, $timezone = null)
    {
        if (($originalDateTime = parent::createFromFormat($format, $time)) === false) {
            return false;
        }
        $originalDateTime->setTimezone($timezone);
        $info = date_parse_from_format($format, $time);

        /** @var $dateTime \DateTime */
        $dateTime = new static;
        if ($info['hour'] === false && $info['minute'] === false && $info['second'] === false) {
            $dateTime->_isDateOnly = true;
        } else {
            $dateTime->_isDateOnly = false;
        }
        $ts = $originalDateTime->getTimestamp();
        $dateTime->setTimezone($originalDateTime->getTimezone());
        $dateTime->setTimestamp($originalDateTime->getTimestamp());

        return $dateTime;
    }
```

So basically the timezone was passed to the phps createFromFormat method anyway. It seems like the problem was that the method was not setting the timezone as it supposed to. If you passed newly created DateTimezone object (eg UTC) to the method - created DateTime object has the timezone property set not to UTC but '+00:00' and it is not correct ID.
